Description: Revert patch riscv: Add RVV memset for multiarch and non-multiarch
 That patch adds an RVV-optimized implementation of memset for RISC-V and
 enables it for both multiarch (IFUNC) and non-multiarch builds.
 .
 The patch currently yields faulty (crashing) ldconfig binaries, when compiled
 with -static-pie, on Launchpad virtualized riscv64 infrastructure.
Bug-Ubuntu: https://bugs.launchpad.net/ubuntu/+source/glibc/+bug/2142067
Forwarded: no
Origin: upstream, https://sourceware.org/git/?p=glibc.git;h=0b8a996f44b5f4c02991f02cd12bf05b17db4576

